#: includes/class-yaydp-i18n.php:386
msgid "The Tiered Pricing rule enables businesses to set distinct price levels for a product based on specific quantity ranges, without applying discounts to quantities that do not meet those ranges."
msgstr "阶梯定价规则使商家能够根据特定数量范围为产品设置不同的价格水平，不满足这些范围的数量不会应用折扣。"

